    "737b91db-0276-493f-a614-1c5a252a967c": {
      "type": "advanced-content",
      "blocks": {
        "template--14970983252022__737b91db-0276-493f-a614-1c5a252a967c-liquid-1": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<h2><b>How to Use<\/b><\/h2>\n<div class=\"how_to_use\">\n<div class=\"d-flex\">\n<img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/2745\/9950\/files\/1_3b1fd07b-5c0e-4e82-b58f-6bcd580218b1.png?v=1693306083\" \/>\n<p>Thoroughly cleanse face and apply sheet mask so that it completely covers face from forehead to chin. Insert lead wire into the two sticky pads, then connect lead wire into your Myolift device.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"d-flex\">\n<img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/2745\/9950\/files\/2_b6055116-e331-41bd-abdb-d47bdcdda5c4.png?v=1693306084\" \/>\n<p>Apply electrodes over the sheet mask- one between eyebrows and one on the decollate.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"d-flex\">\n<img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/2745\/9950\/files\/3_094a75ea-6d7f-4c8b-a069-3b15af88e9ad.png?v=1693306084\" \/>\n<p>Leave on for 15-20 minutes until the serum has completely absorbed. Remove to reveal glow.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/2745\/9950\/files\/Arrow_6_1_copy_2.png?v=1693307083\" \/> MyoLift QT Setting: <\/td>\n<td>Lowest Level<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/2745\/9950\/files\/Arrow_6_1_copy_2.png?v=1693307083\" \/>  MyoLift Mini & MyoLift 600 Setting: <\/td>\n<td>Level 1 on Educate<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/2745\/9950\/files\/Arrow_6_1_copy_2.png?v=1693307083\" \/>  MyoLift MD Setting:<\/td>\n<td>Lowest level on Educate or Iontophoresis<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>",
            "width": "100%",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        }
      },
